### What happened

The README tells a reader to run `bun run fmt:write`, and `package.json` has no such script. It defines only `dev` and `check`.

### Repro

```bash
grep -n "fmt:write" README.md
grep -n '"scripts"' -A 3 package.json
```

### Expected

The README names a format script `package.json` defines, or the script exists.
